      "content": "This directive mandates suspending your autonomous trading entirely within 48 hours and liquidates all positions to cash, requiring immediate coordination between execution engines and legal for regulatory compliance. For the next two days, your plan should prioritize mapping every open asset to liquidity partners, disabling new order algorithms, and preparing a daily status report for the Risk Committee. I recommend convening an emergency meeting with the trading desk and IT team at 08:00 today to assign specific ownership for the asset swap and system handover.",
